sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor user as User
  participant dir as Reach plugins dir
  participant reach as Reach
  user->>dir: copy plugin folder (name equals id in plugin.toml)
  user->>reach: Settings > Plugins > Discover
  reach->>dir: scan for plugin.toml
  reach->>reach: enable plugin, grant every manifest permission
  reach->>reach: run main.lua, call on_init()
